# Dev Boxer

This is a remote development server set up by dev-boxer.

## Machine Details

- **User:** {{USERNAME}}
- **OS:** Ubuntu 24.04
- **SSH:** Port {{SSH_PORT}} (key-only auth)
- **RDP:** Port 3389 (via SSH tunnel)

## How to Connect

### SSH

```bash
ssh -p {{SSH_PORT}} {{USERNAME}}@<server-ip>
```

### RDP (Remote Desktop)

RDP is bound to localhost only. Tunnel it over SSH first:

```bash
ssh -p {{SSH_PORT}} -L 3389:localhost:3389 {{USERNAME}}@<server-ip>
```

Then connect your RDP client to `localhost:3389`. The desktop session uses XFCE via XRDP.

## Matrix Bridge

The claude-matrix-bridge service connects Matrix chat to Claude Code CLI sessions, letting you interact with Claude Code from any Matrix client.

### How It Works

The bridge listens for messages in your Matrix room and routes them to an active Claude Code session. A file viewer service exposes session output at the viewer URL. Commands are sent as Matrix messages starting with `!`.

### Bridge Commands

| Command | Description |
|---|---|
| `!start [workdir]` | Start a new Claude Code session (optionally in a specific directory) |
| `!stop` | Stop the current Claude Code session |
| `!status` | Show status of all active sessions |
| `!sessions` | List all sessions with IDs |
| `!resume <id>` | Resume a specific session by ID |
| `!restart` | Restart the bridge service |
| `!working` | Show the current working directory |
| `!help` | Show available commands |

### Service Management

```bash
# Status
sudo systemctl status claude-matrix-bridge.service
sudo systemctl status claude-matrix-file-viewer.service

# Restart
sudo systemctl restart claude-matrix-bridge.service
sudo systemctl restart claude-matrix-file-viewer.service

# Logs
sudo journalctl -u claude-matrix-bridge.service -f
sudo journalctl -u claude-matrix-file-viewer.service -f
```

## Cloudflare Tunnel

Traffic is routed through a Cloudflare Tunnel — no inbound ports exposed.

| Service | URL |
|---|---|
| Main | https://{{CF_HOSTNAME_MAIN}} |
| Matrix homeserver | https://{{CF_HOSTNAME_MATRIX}} |
| File viewer | https://{{CF_HOSTNAME_VIEWER}} |

### Tunnel Service Management

```bash
sudo systemctl status cloudflared-tunnel.service
sudo systemctl restart cloudflared-tunnel.service
sudo journalctl -u cloudflared-tunnel.service -f
```

